# Ad-hoc lab runs stay untracked. Note `results/*`, not `results/` — git does not
# descend into an ignored DIRECTORY, so a bare `results/` makes the negations below
# unreachable and force-parks any leaf whose deliverable is a recorded artifact.
results/*
# ...except recorded artifacts a mission cites as evidence, which must be committable
# with a plain `git add` (the leaf-executor's merge step does not use -f).
!results/*-run.json
!results/whole-surface-4bd1329e.md
